WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.919
Like we said, another way to help with triggers or bad feelings is journaling.

00:00:03.919 --> 00:00:08.240
We want to show you how this can work using some things we talked about today.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.519
Just like PMR, journaling might feel funny at first, but the more you do it, the more it feels normal.

00:00:13.519 --> 00:00:16.320
You can do journaling on your own or with help from a counselor.

